
Challenge 088, Task #2: Spiral Matrix (Raku)

Usage:
  raku ch-2.raku [<rows> ...]
  raku ch-2.raku [-m[=Pos]] [-n[=Pos]]
  
    [<rows> ...]    One or more same-width rows, each a comma-separated list of one or more positive integers
    -m[=Pos]        Positive integer: matrix height (total number of rows)
    -n[=Pos]        Positive integer: matrix width (total number of columns)
